[{"id":"raa-6-46-1","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"zar ste razmislili?","en":"have you (all) considered?"},{"bs":"zaista ćete vidjeti","en":"surely you (all) will see"},{"bs":"vide","en":"they see"},{"bs":"vidimo","en":"we see"}],"ref":"6:46","answerWord":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/98b62d45ffd8b60b2625.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Have ye imagined, if Allah should take away your hearing and your sight and seal your hearts, Who is the Allah Who could restore it to you save Allah? See how We display the revelations unto them! Yet still they turn away.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَرَءَيْتُمْ","إِنْ","أَخَذَ","ٱللَّهُ","سَمْعَكُمْ","وَأَبْصَٰرَكُمْ","وَخَتَمَ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِكُم","مَّنْ","إِلَٰهٌ","غَيْرُ","ٱللَّهِ","يَأْتِيكُم","بِهِ","ٱنظُرْ","كَيْفَ","نُصَرِّفُ","ٱلْءَايَٰتِ","ثُمَّ","هُمْ","يَصْدِفُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-6-76-4","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidio je","en":"he/it saw"},{"bs":"vidio je sebe","en":"he/it saw himself"},{"bs":"zar ste razmislili?","en":"have you (all) considered?"},{"bs":"pa će vidjeti","en":"so he/it will see"}],"ref":"6:76","answerWord":"رَءَا","answerSound":"audio/ac8ba57264ad722d2b2d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When the night grew dark upon him he beheld a star. He said: This is my Lord. But when it set, he said: I love not things that set.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","جَنَّ","عَلَيْهِ","ٱلَّيْلُ","رَءَا","كَوْكَبًا","قَالَ","هَٰذَا","رَبِّى","فَلَمَّآ","أَفَلَ","قَالَ","لَآ","أُحِبُّ","ٱلْءَافِلِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-18-63-1","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"zar si vidio?","en":"did you see?"},{"bs":"vidite","en":"you (all) see"},{"bs":"vidi","en":"he/it sees"},{"bs":"vidi ga","en":"he/it sees it"}],"ref":"18:63","answerWord":"أَرَءَيْتَ","answerSound":"audio/ed301c71f6498c5a8dde.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Didst thou see, when we took refuge on the rock, and I forgot the fish - and none but Satan caused me to forget to mention it - it took its way into the waters by a marvel.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["قَالَ","أَرَءَيْتَ","إِذْ","أَوَيْنَآ","إِلَى","ٱلصَّخْرَةِ","فَإِنِّى","نَسِيتُ","ٱلْحُوتَ","وَمَآ","أَنسَىٰنِيهُ","إِلَّا","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنُ","أَنْ","أَذْكُرَهُۥ","وَٱتَّخَذَ","سَبِيلَهُۥ","فِى","ٱلْبَحْرِ","عَجَبًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-37-14-1","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidjeli su","en":"they saw"},{"bs":"vide ga","en":"they see it"},{"bs":"pa će vidjeti","en":"so he/it will see"},{"bs":"vidi te","en":"he/it sees you"}],"ref":"37:14","answerWord":"رَأَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/dfa9b8d3364f8d342550.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And seek to scoff when they behold a portent.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","رَأَوْا۟","ءَايَةً","يَسْتَسْخِرُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-4-61-10","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidio si","en":"you saw"},{"bs":"vidio te je","en":"he/it saw you"},{"bs":"i vidimo ga","en":"and we see it"},{"bs":"i vidio je","en":"and he/it saw"}],"ref":"4:61","answerWord":"رَأَيْتَ","answerSound":"audio/370a8b379402523d0f51.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when it is said unto them: Come unto that which Allah hath revealed and unto the messenger, thou seest the hypocrites turn from thee with aversion.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","قِيلَ","لَهُمْ","تَعَالَوْا۟","إِلَىٰ","مَآ","أَنزَلَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَإِلَى","ٱلرَّسُولِ","رَأَيْتَ","ٱلْمُنَٰفِقِينَ","يَصُدُّونَ","عَنكَ","صُدُودًا"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-10-54-13","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidjeli su","en":"they saw"},{"bs":"vidim","en":"I see"},{"bs":"vide ga","en":"they see it"},{"bs":"vidite","en":"you (all) see"}],"ref":"10:54","answerWord":"رَأَوُا۟","answerSound":"audio/5fc9c477bb6925d5872c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if each soul that doeth wrong had all that is in the earth it would seek to ransom itself therewith; and they will feel remorse within them, when they see the doom. But it hath been judged between them fairly and they are not wronged.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["وَلَوْ","أَنَّ","لِكُلِّ","نَفْسٍ","ظَلَمَتْ","مَا","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","لَٱفْتَدَتْ","بِهِۦ","وَأَسَرُّوا۟","ٱلنَّدَامَةَ","لَمَّا","رَأَوُا۟","ٱلْعَذَابَ","وَقُضِىَ","بَيْنَهُم","بِٱلْقِسْطِ","وَهُمْ","لَا","يُظْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-11-27-7","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidimo te","en":"we see you"},{"bs":"vidimo","en":"we see"},{"bs":"vidio je","en":"he/it saw"},{"bs":"vidjeli su je","en":"they saw it"}],"ref":"11:27","answerWord":"نَرَىٰكَ","answerSound":"audio/08d3a4d39034b71deab2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The chieftains of his folk, who disbelieved, said: We see thee but a mortal like us, and we see not that any follow thee save the most abject among us, without reflection. We behold in you no merit above us - nay, we deem you liars.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["فَقَالَ","ٱلْمَلَأُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","مِن","قَوْمِهِۦ","مَا","نَرَىٰكَ","إِلَّا","بَشَرًا","مِّثْلَنَا","وَمَا","نَرَىٰكَ","ٱتَّبَعَكَ","إِلَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","هُمْ","أَرَاذِلُنَا","بَادِىَ","ٱلرَّأْىِ","وَمَا","نَرَىٰ","لَكُمْ","عَلَيْنَا","مِن","فَضْلٍۭ","بَلْ","نَظُنُّكُمْ","كَٰذِبِينَ"],"marked":[7,12],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-20-92-5","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidio si ih","en":"you saw them"},{"bs":"vidio je","en":"he/it saw"},{"bs":"zar ste razmislili?","en":"have you (all) considered?"},{"bs":"vidim te","en":"I see you"}],"ref":"20:92","answerWord":"رَأَيْتَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/811747e356c983cb3b66.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He (Moses) said: O Aaron! What held thee back when thou didst see them gone astray,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["قَالَ","يَٰهَٰرُونُ","مَا","مَنَعَكَ","إِذْ","رَأَيْتَهُمْ","ضَلُّوٓا۟"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-9-26-11","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidite ih","en":"you (all) see them"},{"bs":"vidimo","en":"we see"},{"bs":"biva viđen","en":"he/it is seen"},{"bs":"vidjeli ste je","en":"you (all) saw it"}],"ref":"9:26","answerWord":"تَرَوْهَا","answerSound":"audio/b7e7e0d78cea28faaf60.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then Allah sent His peace of reassurance down upon His messenger and upon the believers, and sent down hosts ye could not see, and punished those who disbelieved. Such is the reward of disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","أَنزَلَ","ٱللَّهُ","سَكِينَتَهُۥ","عَلَىٰ","رَسُولِهِۦ","وَعَلَى","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","وَأَنزَلَ","جُنُودًا","لَّمْ","تَرَوْهَا","وَعَذَّبَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","وَذَٰلِكَ","جَزَآءُ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-10-88-26","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vide","en":"they see"},{"bs":"vide ga","en":"they see it"},{"bs":"pa ga je vidio","en":"so he saw it"},{"bs":"zar ste razmislili?","en":"have you (all) considered?"}],"ref":"10:88","answerWord":"يَرَوُا۟","answerSound":"audio/f843a06aa6c22aa484cd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Moses said: Our Lord! Lo! Thou hast given Pharaoh and his chiefs splendour and riches in the life of the world, Our Lord! that they may lead men astray from Thy way. Our Lord! Destroy their riches and harden their hearts so that they believe not till they see the painful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","مُوسَىٰ","رَبَّنَآ","إِنَّكَ","ءَاتَيْتَ","فِرْعَوْنَ","وَمَلَأَهُۥ","زِينَةً","وَأَمْوَٰلًا","فِى","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","رَبَّنَا","لِيُضِلُّوا۟","عَن","سَبِيلِكَ","رَبَّنَا","ٱطْمِسْ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","وَٱشْدُدْ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِهِمْ","فَلَا","يُؤْمِنُوا۟","حَتَّىٰ","يَرَوُا۟","ٱلْعَذَابَ","ٱلْأَلِيمَ"],"marked":[26],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-13-2-6","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidite ih","en":"you (all) see them"},{"bs":"vidim","en":"I see"},{"bs":"biva viđen","en":"he/it is seen"},{"bs":"vidi","en":"he/it sees"}],"ref":"13:2","answerWord":"تَرَوْنَهَا","answerSound":"audio/dd6260f62ba30078d975.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah it is Who raised up the heavens without visible supports, then mounted the Throne, and compelled the sun and the moon to be of service, each runneth unto an appointed term; He ordereth the course; He detaileth the revelations, that haply ye may be certain of the meeting with your Lord.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِى","رَفَعَ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","بِغَيْرِ","عَمَدٍ","تَرَوْنَهَا","ثُمَّ","ٱسْتَوَىٰ","عَلَى","ٱلْعَرْشِ","وَسَخَّرَ","ٱلشَّمْسَ","وَٱلْقَمَرَ","كُلٌّ","يَجْرِى","لِأَجَلٍ","مُّسَمًّى","يُدَبِّرُ","ٱلْأَمْرَ","يُفَصِّلُ","ٱلْءَايَٰتِ","لَعَلَّكُم","بِلِقَآءِ","رَبِّكُمْ","تُوقِنُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-53-19-0","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"jeste li vidjeli (razmislili)","en":"have you seen (considered)"},{"bs":"vidjela ih je","en":"she/it saw them"},{"bs":"vidi te","en":"he/it sees you"},{"bs":"vidjele su ga","en":"they saw him"}],"ref":"53:19","answerWord":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ","answerSound":"audio/11952b79797f3aa244c8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Have ye thought upon Al-Lat and Al-'Uzza","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ","ٱللَّٰتَ","وَٱلْعُزَّىٰ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-10-59-1","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"zar ste razmislili?","en":"have you (all) considered?"},{"bs":"i vidio si","en":"and you saw"},{"bs":"vidi ga","en":"he/it sees him"},{"bs":"vidjeli su te","en":"they saw you"}],"ref":"10:59","answerWord":"أَرَءَيْتُم","answerSound":"audio/fca5fa7fe579be2494d6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Have ye considered what provision Allah hath sent down for you, how ye have made of it lawful and unlawful? Hath Allah permitted you, or do ye invent a lie concerning Allah?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَرَءَيْتُم","مَّآ","أَنزَلَ","ٱللَّهُ","لَكُم","مِّن","رِّزْقٍ","فَجَعَلْتُم","مِّنْهُ","حَرَامًا","وَحَلَٰلًا","قُلْ","ءَآللَّهُ","أَذِنَ","لَكُمْ","أَمْ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","تَفْتَرُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-11-29-19","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidim vas","en":"I see you (all)"},{"bs":"vidio si ih","en":"you saw them"},{"bs":"vidi","en":"he/it sees"},{"bs":"vidim te","en":"I see you"}],"ref":"11:29","answerWord":"أَرَىٰكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/ce11f085e8a88053c2ec.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And O my people! I ask of you no wealth therefor. My reward is the concern only of Allah, and I am not going to thrust away those who believe - Lo! they have to meet their Lord! - but I see you a folk that are ignorant.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["وَيَٰقَوْمِ","لَآ","أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ","عَلَيْهِ","مَالًا","إِنْ","أَجْرِىَ","إِلَّا","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","وَمَآ","أَنَا۠","بِطَارِدِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِنَّهُم","مُّلَٰقُوا۟","رَبِّهِمْ","وَلَٰكِنِّىٓ","أَرَىٰكُمْ","قَوْمًا","تَجْهَلُونَ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-21-30-1","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidi","en":"he/it sees"},{"bs":"pa ga je vidio","en":"so he saw it"},{"bs":"vide ih","en":"they see them"},{"bs":"vide ga","en":"they see it"}],"ref":"21:30","answerWord":"يَرَ","answerSound":"audio/20709f96284030f0dcc0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Have not those who disbelieve known that the heavens and the earth were of one piece, then We parted them, and we made every living thing of water? Will they not then believe?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["أَوَلَمْ","يَرَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوٓا۟","أَنَّ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضَ","كَانَتَا","رَتْقًا","فَفَتَقْنَٰهُمَا","وَجَعَلْنَا","مِنَ","ٱلْمَآءِ","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","حَىٍّ","أَفَلَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-25-40-10","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vide ga","en":"they see it"},{"bs":"vide","en":"they see"},{"bs":"vidi","en":"he/it sees"},{"bs":"vidite ih","en":"you (all) see them"}],"ref":"25:40","answerWord":"يَرَوْنَهَا","answerSound":"audio/28389ba975f65faf09bf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And indeed they have passed by the township whereon was rained the fatal rain. Can it be that they have not seen it? Nay, but they hope for no resurrection.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","أَتَوْا۟","عَلَى","ٱلْقَرْيَةِ","ٱلَّتِىٓ","أُمْطِرَتْ","مَطَرَ","ٱلسَّوْءِ","أَفَلَمْ","يَكُونُوا۟","يَرَوْنَهَا","بَلْ","كَانُوا۟","لَا","يَرْجُونَ","نُشُورًا"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-27-10-3","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidio ga je","en":"he/it saw it"},{"bs":"vidjeli su ga","en":"they saw it"},{"bs":"vidjeli su","en":"they saw"},{"bs":"vidimo","en":"we see"}],"ref":"27:10","answerWord":"رَءَاهَا","answerSound":"audio/5e405bf301a6ce04b3bf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And throw down thy staff! But when he saw it writhing as it were a demon, he turned to flee headlong; (but it was said unto him): O Moses! Fear not! the emissaries fear not in My presence,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["وَأَلْقِ","عَصَاكَ","فَلَمَّا","رَءَاهَا","تَهْتَزُّ","كَأَنَّهَا","جَآنٌّ","وَلَّىٰ","مُدْبِرًا","وَلَمْ","يُعَقِّبْ","يَٰمُوسَىٰ","لَا","تَخَفْ","إِنِّى","لَا","يَخَافُ","لَدَىَّ","ٱلْمُرْسَلُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-31-20-1","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidite","en":"you (all) see"},{"bs":"vidi ga","en":"he/it sees it"},{"bs":"i vidjet će","en":"and he/it will see"},{"bs":"vidite ih","en":"you (all) see them"}],"ref":"31:20","answerWord":"تَرَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/b16ee1be293fc63185c2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"See ye not how Allah hath made serviceable unto you whatsoever is in the skies and whatsoever is in the earth and hath loaded you with His favours both without and within? Yet of mankind is he who disputeth concerning Allah, without knowledge or guidance or a scripture giving light.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["أَلَمْ","تَرَوْا۟","أَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","سَخَّرَ","لَكُم","مَّا","فِى","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَمَا","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَأَسْبَغَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","نِعَمَهُۥ","ظَٰهِرَةً","وَبَاطِنَةً","وَمِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","مَن","يُجَٰدِلُ","فِى","ٱللَّهِ","بِغَيْرِ","عِلْمٍ","وَلَا","هُدًى","وَلَا","كِتَٰبٍ","مُّنِيرٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-35-8-5","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ga je vidio","en":"so he saw it"},{"bs":"vidimo","en":"we see"},{"bs":"vidi ga","en":"he/it sees it"},{"bs":"vidim vas","en":"I see you (all)"}],"ref":"35:8","answerWord":"فَرَءَاهُ","answerSound":"audio/b84bb55b12841abf2964.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Is he, the evil of whose deeds is made fairseeming unto him so that he deemeth it good, (other than Satan's dupe)? Allah verily sendeth whom He will astray, and guideth whom He will; so let not thy soul expire in sighings for them. Lo! Allah is Aware of what they do!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["أَفَمَن","زُيِّنَ","لَهُۥ","سُوٓءُ","عَمَلِهِۦ","فَرَءَاهُ","حَسَنًا","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُضِلُّ","مَن","يَشَآءُ","وَيَهْدِى","مَن","يَشَآءُ","فَلَا","تَذْهَبْ","نَفْسُكَ","عَلَيْهِمْ","حَسَرَٰتٍ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِمَا","يَصْنَعُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"raa-46-24-1","words":["verb:raa"],"options":[{"bs":"vidjeli su ga","en":"they saw it"},{"bs":"vide","en":"they see"},{"bs":"vidjela ga je","en":"she/it saw it"},{"bs":"vidite ih","en":"you (all) see them"}],"ref":"46:24","answerWord":"رَأَوْهُ","answerSound":"audio/e22a35a2c682bceda840.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then, when they beheld it as a dense cloud coming toward their valleys, they said: Here is a cloud bringing us rain. Nay, but it is that which ye did seek to hasten, a wind wherein is painful torment,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vidjeti","en":"to see"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","رَأَوْهُ","عَارِضًا","مُّسْتَقْبِلَ","أَوْدِيَتِهِمْ","قَالُوا۟","هَٰذَا","عَارِضٌ","مُّمْطِرُنَا","بَلْ","هُوَ","مَا","ٱسْتَعْجَلْتُم","بِهِۦ","رِيحٌ","فِيهَا","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَأَى"}},{"id":"ahya-2-28-9","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"oživljava vas","en":"he/it gives you (all) life"},{"bs":"oživio vas je","en":"he/it gave you (all) life"},{"bs":"oživljava","en":"he/it gives life"},{"bs":"i oživljavam","en":"and I give life"}],"ref":"2:28","answerWord":"يُحْيِيكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/32ec59d27e10e3c89518.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How disbelieve ye in Allah when ye were dead and He gave life to you! Then He will give you death, then life again, and then unto Him ye will return.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["كَيْفَ","تَكْفُرُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَكُنتُمْ","أَمْوَٰتًا","فَأَحْيَٰكُمْ","ثُمَّ","يُمِيتُكُمْ","ثُمَّ","يُحْيِيكُمْ","ثُمَّ","إِلَيْهِ","تُرْجَعُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-15-23-2","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"oživljavamo","en":"we give life"},{"bs":"oživljava","en":"he/it gives life"},{"bs":"oživljavam","en":"I give life"},{"bs":"oživio ju je","en":"he/it gave it life"}],"ref":"15:23","answerWord":"نُحْىِۦ","answerSound":"audio/3bcb15ea90f1097841dc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! and it is We, even We, Who quicken and give death, and We are the Inheritor.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["وَإِنَّا","لَنَحْنُ","نُحْىِۦ","وَنُمِيتُ","وَنَحْنُ","ٱلْوَٰرِثُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-46-33-14","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"oživljava","en":"he/it gives life"},{"bs":"i oživljavam","en":"and I give life"},{"bs":"oživljavamo","en":"we give life"},{"bs":"pa smo ga oživili","en":"so we gave him life"}],"ref":"46:33","answerWord":"يُحْۦِىَ","answerSound":"audio/a7c6fff20aea04399a31.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Have they not seen that Allah, Who created the heavens and the earth and was not wearied by their creation, is Able to give life to the dead? Aye, He verily is Able to do all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["أَوَلَمْ","يَرَوْا۟","أَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","ٱلَّذِى","خَلَقَ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضَ","وَلَمْ","يَعْىَ","بِخَلْقِهِنَّ","بِقَٰدِرٍ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَن","يُحْۦِىَ","ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","بَلَىٰٓ","إِنَّهُۥ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","قَدِيرٌ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-2-28-5","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"pa vas je oživio","en":"so he/it gave you (all) life"},{"bs":"pa je oživio","en":"so he/it gave life"},{"bs":"oživio ih je","en":"he/it gave them life"},{"bs":"oživio ju je","en":"he/it gave it life"}],"ref":"2:28","answerWord":"فَأَحْيَٰكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/e11cfffeac5223280d77.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How disbelieve ye in Allah when ye were dead and He gave life to you! Then He will give you death, then life again, and then unto Him ye will return.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["كَيْفَ","تَكْفُرُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَكُنتُمْ","أَمْوَٰتًا","فَأَحْيَٰكُمْ","ثُمَّ","يُمِيتُكُمْ","ثُمَّ","يُحْيِيكُمْ","ثُمَّ","إِلَيْهِ","تُرْجَعُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-2-243-16","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"oživio ih je","en":"he/it gave them life"},{"bs":"oživljava","en":"he/it gives life"},{"bs":"oživio vas je","en":"he/it gave you (all) life"},{"bs":"i On je dao život","en":"and He gave life"}],"ref":"2:243","answerWord":"أَحْيَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/ff254cd72f342545a62c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Bethink thee (O Muhammad) of those of old, who went forth from their habitations in their thousands, fearing death, and Allah said unto them: Die; and then He brought them back to life. Lo! Allah is a Lord of Kindness to mankind, but most of mankind give not thanks.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["أَلَمْ","تَرَ","إِلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","خَرَجُوا۟","مِن","دِيَٰرِهِمْ","وَهُمْ","أُلُوفٌ","حَذَرَ","ٱلْمَوْتِ","فَقَالَ","لَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","مُوتُوا۟","ثُمَّ","أَحْيَٰهُمْ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَذُو","فَضْلٍ","عَلَى","ٱلنَّاسِ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","أَكْثَرَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","لَا","يَشْكُرُونَ"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-6-122-3","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo ga oživili","en":"so we gave him life"},{"bs":"oživljavam","en":"I give life"},{"bs":"(zatim) će me oživiti","en":"(then) He will give me life"},{"bs":"oživljava","en":"he/it gives life"}],"ref":"6:122","answerWord":"فَأَحْيَيْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/639f3f26ee41149e4ea5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Is he who was dead and We have raised him unto life, and set for him a light wherein he walketh among men, as him whose similitude is in utter darkness whence he cannot emerge? Thus is their conduct made fairseeming for the disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["أَوَمَن","كَانَ","مَيْتًا","فَأَحْيَيْنَٰهُ","وَجَعَلْنَا","لَهُۥ","نُورًا","يَمْشِى","بِهِۦ","فِى","ٱلنَّاسِ","كَمَن","مَّثَلُهُۥ","فِى","ٱلظُّلُمَٰتِ","لَيْسَ","بِخَارِجٍ","مِّنْهَا","كَذَٰلِكَ","زُيِّنَ","لِلْكَٰفِرِينَ","مَا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-22-66-2","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"oživio vas je","en":"he/it gave you (all) life"},{"bs":"da oživimo","en":"so that we may give life"},{"bs":"oživio je","en":"he/it gave life"},{"bs":"pa oživljava","en":"so he/it gives life"}],"ref":"22:66","answerWord":"أَحْيَاكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/7bbc306f390ed7266220.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And He it is Who gave you life, then He will cause you to die, and then will give you life (again). Lo! man is verily an ingrate.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["وَهُوَ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَحْيَاكُمْ","ثُمَّ","يُمِيتُكُمْ","ثُمَّ","يُحْيِيكُمْ","إِنَّ","ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ","لَكَفُورٌ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-25-49-0","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"da oživimo","en":"so that we may give life"},{"bs":"pa vas je oživio","en":"so he/it gave you (all) life"},{"bs":"oživljava ih","en":"he/it gives them life"},{"bs":"oživljava vas","en":"he/it gives you (all) life"}],"ref":"25:49","answerWord":"لِّنُحْۦِىَ","answerSound":"audio/dfbc8383e9920f82f7c9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That We may give life thereby to a dead land, and We give many beasts and men that We have created to drink thereof.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["لِّنُحْۦِىَ","بِهِۦ","بَلْدَةً","مَّيْتًا","وَنُسْقِيَهُۥ","مِمَّا","خَلَقْنَآ","أَنْعَٰمًا","وَأَنَاسِىَّ","كَثِيرًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-26-81-3","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"(zatim) će me oživiti","en":"(then) He will give me life"},{"bs":"pa smo ga oživili","en":"so we gave him life"},{"bs":"pa oživljava","en":"so he/it gives life"},{"bs":"oživljava vas","en":"he/it gives you (all) life"}],"ref":"26:81","answerWord":"يُحْيِينِ","answerSound":"audio/3150ce0aa704f60a2dfa.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Who causeth me to die, then giveth me life (again),","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِى","يُمِيتُنِى","ثُمَّ","يُحْيِينِ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-30-19-8","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"i oživljava","en":"and he/it gives life"},{"bs":"pa smo oživili","en":"so we gave life"},{"bs":"pa smo ga oživili","en":"so we gave him life"},{"bs":"i oživljavam","en":"and I give life"}],"ref":"30:19","answerWord":"وَيُحْىِ","answerSound":"audio/469352bfcf05cfa69941.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He bringeth forth the living from the dead, and He bringeth forth the dead from the living, and He reviveth the earth after her death. And even so will ye be brought forth.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["يُخْرِجُ","ٱلْحَىَّ","مِنَ","ٱلْمَيِّتِ","وَيُخْرِجُ","ٱلْمَيِّتَ","مِنَ","ٱلْحَىِّ","وَيُحْىِ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","بَعْدَ","مَوْتِهَا","وَكَذَٰلِكَ","تُخْرَجُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-30-24-10","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"pa oživljava","en":"so he/it gives life"},{"bs":"oživljavamo","en":"we give life"},{"bs":"pa vas je oživio","en":"so he/it gave you (all) life"},{"bs":"pa smo oživili","en":"so we gave life"}],"ref":"30:24","answerWord":"فَيُحْىِۦ","answerSound":"audio/1fcf78606c8965123a61.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And of His signs is this: He showeth you the lightning for a fear and for a hope, and sendeth down water from the sky, and thereby quickeneth the earth after her death. Lo! herein indeed are portents for folk who understand.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["وَمِنْ","ءَايَٰتِهِۦ","يُرِيكُمُ","ٱلْبَرْقَ","خَوْفًا","وَطَمَعًا","وَيُنَزِّلُ","مِنَ","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","مَآءً","فَيُحْىِۦ","بِهِ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","بَعْدَ","مَوْتِهَآ","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَءَايَٰتٍ","لِّقَوْمٍ","يَعْقِلُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-35-9-10","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo oživili","en":"so we gave life"},{"bs":"oživljavam","en":"I give life"},{"bs":"i On je dao život","en":"and He gave life"},{"bs":"pa vas je oživio","en":"so he/it gave you (all) life"}],"ref":"35:9","answerWord":"فَأَحْيَيْنَا","answerSound":"audio/9760010fa90eed82026f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Allah it is Who sendeth the winds and they raise a cloud; then We lead it unto a dead land and revive therewith the earth after its death. Such is the Resurrection.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["وَٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَرْسَلَ","ٱلرِّيَٰحَ","فَتُثِيرُ","سَحَابًا","فَسُقْنَٰهُ","إِلَىٰ","بَلَدٍ","مَّيِّتٍ","فَأَحْيَيْنَا","بِهِ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","بَعْدَ","مَوْتِهَا","كَذَٰلِكَ","ٱلنُّشُورُ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-36-12-2","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"oživljavamo","en":"we give life"},{"bs":"oživljava","en":"he/it gives life"},{"bs":"oživio ih je","en":"he/it gave them life"},{"bs":"pa je oživio","en":"so he/it gave life"}],"ref":"36:12","answerWord":"نُحْىِ","answerSound":"audio/2609f12276692a663202.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We it is Who bring the dead to life. We record that which they send before (them, and their footprints. And all things We have kept in a clear Register.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["إِنَّا","نَحْنُ","نُحْىِ","ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","وَنَكْتُبُ","مَا","قَدَّمُوا۟","وَءَاثَٰرَهُمْ","وَكُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","أَحْصَيْنَٰهُ","فِىٓ","إِمَامٍ","مُّبِينٍ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-36-33-4","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"oživili smo je","en":"we gave it life"},{"bs":"oživljavamo","en":"we give life"},{"bs":"pa vas je oživio","en":"so he/it gave you (all) life"},{"bs":"i oživio si nas","en":"and you gave us life"}],"ref":"36:33","answerWord":"أَحْيَيْنَٰهَا","answerSound":"audio/0d701d7ce15ec5a7a68e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"A token unto them is the dead earth. We revive it, and We bring forth from it grain so that they eat thereof;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["وَءَايَةٌ","لَّهُمُ","ٱلْأَرْضُ","ٱلْمَيْتَةُ","أَحْيَيْنَٰهَا","وَأَخْرَجْنَا","مِنْهَا","حَبًّا","فَمِنْهُ","يَأْكُلُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-36-79-1","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"oživljava ih","en":"he/it gives them life"},{"bs":"pa smo ga oživili","en":"so we gave him life"},{"bs":"(zatim) će me oživiti","en":"(then) He will give me life"},{"bs":"oživio vas je","en":"he/it gave you (all) life"}],"ref":"36:79","answerWord":"يُحْيِيهَا","answerSound":"audio/394ddcbce00a17f42ed6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: He will revive them Who produced them at the first, for He is Knower of every creation,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["قُلْ","يُحْيِيهَا","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَنشَأَهَآ","أَوَّلَ","مَرَّةٍ","وَهُوَ","بِكُلِّ","خَلْقٍ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-40-11-4","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"i oživio si nas","en":"and you gave us life"},{"bs":"pa smo oživili","en":"so we gave life"},{"bs":"pa je oživio","en":"so he/it gave life"},{"bs":"oživili smo je","en":"we gave it life"}],"ref":"40:11","answerWord":"وَأَحْيَيْتَنَا","answerSound":"audio/d7e98df7b93735e170ea.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They say: Our Lord! Twice hast Thou made us die, and twice hast Thou made us live. Now we confess our sins. Is there any way to go out?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","رَبَّنَآ","أَمَتَّنَا","ٱثْنَتَيْنِ","وَأَحْيَيْتَنَا","ٱثْنَتَيْنِ","فَٱعْتَرَفْنَا","بِذُنُوبِنَا","فَهَلْ","إِلَىٰ","خُرُوجٍ","مِّن","سَبِيلٍ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-50-11-2","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"i oživili smo","en":"and we gave life"},{"bs":"i oživljava","en":"and he/it gives life"},{"bs":"da oživimo","en":"so that we may give life"},{"bs":"oživljava ih","en":"he/it gives them life"}],"ref":"50:11","answerWord":"وَأَحْيَيْنَا","answerSound":"audio/bc86e55dfde8bd278eac.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Provision (made) for men; and therewith We quicken a dead land. Even so will be the resurrection of the dead.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["رِّزْقًا","لِّلْعِبَادِ","وَأَحْيَيْنَا","بِهِۦ","بَلْدَةً","مَّيْتًا","كَذَٰلِكَ","ٱلْخُرُوجُ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"ahya-53-44-3","words":["verb:ahya"],"options":[{"bs":"i On je dao život","en":"and He gave life"},{"bs":"oživljavamo","en":"we give life"},{"bs":"(zatim) će me oživiti","en":"(then) He will give me life"},{"bs":"pa smo oživili","en":"so we gave life"}],"ref":"53:44","answerWord":"وَأَحْيَا","answerSound":"audio/c88b27040e52d50e46b0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And that He it is Who giveth death and giveth life;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"oživiti","en":"to give life, to revive"},"passage":["وَأَنَّهُۥ","هُوَ","أَمَاتَ","وَأَحْيَا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْيا"}},{"id":"waqa-3-16-8","words":["verb:waqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i sačuvaj nas","en":"and protect us"},{"bs":"i sačuvaj ih","en":"and protect them"},{"bs":"i zaštitio ih je","en":"and he/it protected them"},{"bs":"sačuvaš","en":"You protect"}],"ref":"3:16","answerWord":"وَقِنَا","answerSound":"audio/73220379b2c79cf55c0c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who say: Our Lord! Lo! we believe. So forgive us our sins and guard us from the punishment of Fire;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaštititi, sačuvati","en":"to protect, to guard"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يَقُولُونَ","رَبَّنَآ","إِنَّنَآ","ءَامَنَّا","فَٱغْفِرْ","لَنَا","ذُنُوبَنَا","وَقِنَا","عَذَابَ","ٱلنَّارِ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"وَقَى"}},{"id":"waqa-44-56-7","words":["verb:waqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i zaštitio ih je","en":"and he/it protected them"},{"bs":"i sačuvaj ih","en":"and protect them"},{"bs":"biva zaštićen","en":"he/it is protected"},{"bs":"pa nas zaštiti!","en":"so protect us!"}],"ref":"44:56","answerWord":"وَوَقَىٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/43918b2748e7c20c313d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They taste not death therein, save the first death. And He hath saved them from the doom of hell,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaštititi, sačuvati","en":"to protect, to guard"},"passage":["لَا","يَذُوقُونَ","فِيهَا","ٱلْمَوْتَ","إِلَّا","ٱلْمَوْتَةَ","ٱلْأُولَىٰ","وَوَقَىٰهُمْ","عَذَابَ","ٱلْجَحِيمِ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"وَقَى"}},{"id":"waqa-3-191-18","words":["verb:waqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa nas zaštiti!","en":"so protect us!"},{"bs":"i sačuvaj ih","en":"and protect them"},{"bs":"pa ga je zaštitio","en":"so he/it protected him"},{"bs":"sačuvaš","en":"You protect"}],"ref":"3:191","answerWord":"فَقِنَا","answerSound":"audio/e70f8943a217c3c1e976.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Such as remember Allah, standing, sitting, and reclining, and consider the creation of the heavens and the earth, (and say): Our Lord! Thou createdst not this in vain. Glory be to Thee! Preserve us from the doom of Fire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaštititi, sačuvati","en":"to protect, to guard"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يَذْكُرُونَ","ٱللَّهَ","قِيَٰمًا","وَقُعُودًا","وَعَلَىٰ","جُنُوبِهِمْ","وَيَتَفَكَّرُونَ","فِى","خَلْقِ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","رَبَّنَا","مَا","خَلَقْتَ","هَٰذَا","بَٰطِلًا","سُبْحَٰنَكَ","فَقِنَا","عَذَابَ","ٱلنَّارِ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"وَقَى"}},{"id":"waqa-40-7-24","words":["verb:waqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i zaštiti ih!","en":"and protect them!"},{"bs":"zaštitite!","en":"(you all) protect!"},{"bs":"i sačuvaj nas","en":"and protect us"},{"bs":"i sačuvao nas je","en":"and He protected us"}],"ref":"40:7","answerWord":"وَقِهِمْ","answerSound":"audio/63c22eabd9e2b4f66f76.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who bear the Throne, and all who are round about it, hymn the praises of their Lord and believe in Him and ask forgiveness for those who believe (saying): Our Lord! Thou comprehendest all things in mercy and knowledge, therefor forgive those who repent and follow Thy way. Ward off from them the punishment of hell.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaštititi, sačuvati","en":"to protect, to guard"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يَحْمِلُونَ","ٱلْعَرْشَ","وَمَنْ","حَوْلَهُۥ","يُسَبِّحُونَ","بِحَمْدِ","رَبِّهِمْ","وَيُؤْمِنُونَ","بِهِۦ","وَيَسْتَغْفِرُونَ","لِلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","رَبَّنَا","وَسِعْتَ","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","رَّحْمَةً","وَعِلْمًا","فَٱغْفِرْ","لِلَّذِينَ","تَابُوا۟","وَٱتَّبَعُوا۟","سَبِيلَكَ","وَقِهِمْ","عَذَابَ","ٱلْجَحِيمِ"],"marked":[24],"facts":{"verb":"وَقَى"}},{"id":"waqa-40-9-0","words":["verb:waqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i sačuvaj ih","en":"and protect them"},{"bs":"sačuvaš","en":"You protect"},{"bs":"biva zaštićen","en":"he/it is protected"},{"bs":"zaštitite!","en":"(you all) protect!"}],"ref":"40:9","answerWord":"وَقِهِمُ","answerSound":"audio/47d4900f0694ebea99e1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And ward off from them ill-deeds; and he from whom Thou wardest off ill-deeds that day, him verily hast Thou taken into mercy. That is the supreme triumph.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaštititi, sačuvati","en":"to protect, to guard"},"passage":["وَقِهِمُ","ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ","وَمَن","تَقِ","ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ","يَوْمَئِذٍ","فَقَدْ","رَحِمْتَهُۥ","وَذَٰلِكَ","هُوَ","ٱلْفَوْزُ","ٱلْعَظِيمُ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"وَقَى"}},{"id":"waqa-40-45-0","words":["verb:waqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ga je zaštitio","en":"so he/it protected him"},{"bs":"i sačuvao nas je","en":"and He protected us"},{"bs":"i sačuvaj nas","en":"and protect us"},{"bs":"i zaštiti ih!","en":"and protect them!"}],"ref":"40:45","answerWord":"فَوَقَىٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/60ca76c66409b6ce0805.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So Allah warded off from him the evils which they plotted, while a dreadful doom encompassed Pharaoh's folk,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaštititi, sačuvati","en":"to protect, to guard"},"passage":["فَوَقَىٰهُ","ٱللَّهُ","سَيِّـَٔاتِ","مَا","مَكَرُوا۟","وَحَاقَ","بِـَٔالِ","فِرْعَوْنَ","سُوٓءُ","ٱلْعَذَابِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"وَقَى"}},{"id":"waqa-52-27-3","words":["verb:waqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i sačuvao nas je","en":"and He protected us"},{"bs":"biva zaštićen","en":"he/it is protected"},{"bs":"pa ga je zaštitio","en":"so he/it protected him"},{"bs":"i sačuvaj nas","en":"and protect us"}],"ref":"52:27","answerWord":"وَوَقَىٰنَا","answerSound":"audio/2e9ceae3f2c6503f46c0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But Allah hath been gracious unto us and hath preserved us from the torment of the breath of Fire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaštititi, sačuvati","en":"to protect, to guard"},"passage":["فَمَنَّ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَيْنَا","وَوَقَىٰنَا","عَذَابَ","ٱلسَّمُومِ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"وَقَى"}},{"id":"waqa-66-6-3","words":["verb:waqa"],"options":[{"bs":"zaštitite!","en":"(you all) protect!"},{"bs":"i sačuvao nas je","en":"and He protected us"},{"bs":"pa ga je zaštitio","en":"so he/it protected him"},{"bs":"i sačuvaj ih","en":"and protect them"}],"ref":"66:6","answerWord":"قُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/8bef34d63099653eb5e9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Ward off from yourselves and your families a Fire whereof the fuel is men and stones, over which are set angels strong, severe, who resist not Allah in that which He commandeth them, but do that which they are commanded.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaštititi, sačuvati","en":"to protect, to guard"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","قُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَكُمْ","وَأَهْلِيكُمْ","نَارًا","وَقُودُهَا","ٱلنَّاسُ","وَٱلْحِجَارَةُ","عَلَيْهَا","مَلَٰٓئِكَةٌ","غِلَاظٌ","شِدَادٌ","لَّا","يَعْصُونَ","ٱللَّهَ","مَآ","أَمَرَهُمْ","وَيَفْعَلُونَ","مَا","يُؤْمَرُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"وَقَى"}},{"id":"rawada-12-32-6","words":["verb:rawada"],"options":[{"bs":"nagovarao sam ga","en":"I tried to persuade him"},{"bs":"nagovarat ćemo","en":"we will try to persuade"},{"bs":"nagovarala me je","en":"she/it tried to persuade me"},{"bs":"nagovarale ste","en":"you (all) tried to persuade"}],"ref":"12:32","answerWord":"رَٰوَدتُّهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/621bb3d7afe0ddbd1fdf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"She said: This is he on whose account ye blamed me. I asked of him an evil act, but he proved continent, but if he do not my behest he verily shall be imprisoned, and verily shall be of those brought low.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nagovarati, mamiti","en":"to try to persuade, to entice"},"passage":["قَالَتْ","فَذَٰلِكُنَّ","ٱلَّذِى","لُمْتُنَّنِى","فِيهِ","وَلَقَدْ","رَٰوَدتُّهُۥ","عَن","نَّفْسِهِۦ","فَٱسْتَعْصَمَ","وَلَئِن","لَّمْ","يَفْعَلْ","مَآ","ءَامُرُهُۥ","لَيُسْجَنَنَّ","وَلَيَكُونًا","مِّنَ","ٱلصَّٰغِرِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"رَاوَدَ"}},{"id":"rawada-12-23-0","words":["verb:rawada"],"options":[{"bs":"i nagovarala ga je","en":"and she/it tried to persuade him"},{"bs":"nagovarala me je","en":"she/it tried to persuade me"},{"bs":"nagovarale ste","en":"you (all) tried to persuade"},{"bs":"nagovarao sam ga","en":"I tried to persuade him"}],"ref":"12:23","answerWord":"وَرَٰوَدَتْهُ","answerSound":"audio/85c6bdcf487a6b88fa5f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And she, in whose house he was, asked of him an evil act. She bolted the doors and said: Come! He said: I seek refuge in Allah! Lo! he is my lord, who hath treated me honourably. Lo! wrong-doers never prosper.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nagovarati, mamiti","en":"to try to persuade, to entice"},"passage":["وَرَٰوَدَتْهُ","ٱلَّتِى","هُوَ","فِى","بَيْتِهَا","عَن","نَّفْسِهِۦ","وَغَلَّقَتِ","ٱلْأَبْوَٰبَ","وَقَالَتْ","هَيْتَ","لَكَ","قَالَ","مَعَاذَ","ٱللَّهِ","إِنَّهُۥ","رَبِّىٓ","أَحْسَنَ","مَثْوَاىَ","إِنَّهُۥ","لَا","يُفْلِحُ","ٱلظَّٰلِمُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"رَاوَدَ"}},{"id":"rawada-12-26-2","words":["verb:rawada"],"options":[{"bs":"nagovarala me je","en":"she/it tried to persuade me"},{"bs":"nagovarali su ga","en":"they tried to entice him"},{"bs":"i nagovarala ga je","en":"and she/it tried to persuade him"},{"bs":"nagovarale ste","en":"you (all) tried to persuade"}],"ref":"12:26","answerWord":"رَٰوَدَتْنِى","answerSound":"audio/58da5b1d0340602b03e8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Joseph) said: She it was who asked of me an evil act. And a witness of her own folk testified: If his shirt is torn from before, then she speaketh truth and he is of the liars.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nagovarati, mamiti","en":"to try to persuade, to entice"},"passage":["قَالَ","هِىَ","رَٰوَدَتْنِى","عَن","نَّفْسِى","وَشَهِدَ","شَاهِدٌ","مِّنْ","أَهْلِهَآ","إِن","كَانَ","قَمِيصُهُۥ","قُدَّ","مِن","قُبُلٍ","فَصَدَقَتْ","وَهُوَ","مِنَ","ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"رَاوَدَ"}},{"id":"rawada-12-51-4","words":["verb:rawada"],"options":[{"bs":"nagovarale ste","en":"you (all) tried to persuade"},{"bs":"nagovarao sam ga","en":"I tried to persuade him"},{"bs":"nagovarali su ga","en":"they tried to entice him"},{"bs":"i nagovarala ga je","en":"and she/it tried to persuade him"}],"ref":"12:51","answerWord":"رَٰوَدتُّنَّ","answerSound":"audio/512ab85581e27b7c7463.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He (the king) (then sent for those women and) said: What happened when ye asked an evil act of Joseph? They answered: Allah Blameless! We know no evil of him. Said the wife of the ruler: Now the truth is out. I asked of him an evil act, and he is surely of the truthful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nagovarati, mamiti","en":"to try to persuade, to entice"},"passage":["قَالَ","مَا","خَطْبُكُنَّ","إِذْ","رَٰوَدتُّنَّ","يُوسُفَ","عَن","نَّفْسِهِۦ","قُلْنَ","حَٰشَ","لِلَّهِ","مَا","عَلِمْنَا","عَلَيْهِ","مِن","سُوٓءٍ","قَالَتِ","ٱمْرَأَتُ","ٱلْعَزِيزِ","ٱلْـَٰٔنَ","حَصْحَصَ","ٱلْحَقُّ","أَنَا۠","رَٰوَدتُّهُۥ","عَن","نَّفْسِهِۦ","وَإِنَّهُۥ","لَمِنَ","ٱلصَّٰدِقِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"رَاوَدَ"}},{"id":"rawada-12-61-1","words":["verb:rawada"],"options":[{"bs":"nagovarat ćemo","en":"we will try to persuade"},{"bs":"nagovarale ste","en":"you (all) tried to persuade"},{"bs":"i nagovarala ga je","en":"and she/it tried to persuade him"},{"bs":"nagovarao sam ga","en":"I tried to persuade him"}],"ref":"12:61","answerWord":"سَنُرَٰوِدُ","answerSound":"audio/2d67f53e55e6238bee9b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: We will try to win him from his father: that we will surely do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nagovarati, mamiti","en":"to try to persuade, to entice"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","سَنُرَٰوِدُ","عَنْهُ","أَبَاهُ","وَإِنَّا","لَفَٰعِلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَاوَدَ"}},{"id":"rawada-54-37-1","words":["verb:rawada"],"options":[{"bs":"nagovarali su ga","en":"they tried to entice him"},{"bs":"nagovarala me je","en":"she/it tried to persuade me"},{"bs":"nagovarao sam ga","en":"I tried to persuade him"},{"bs":"nagovarat ćemo","en":"we will try to persuade"}],"ref":"54:37","answerWord":"رَٰوَدُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/d1b6636f47e8f85e1e51.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They even asked of him his guests for an ill purpose. Then We blinded their eyes (and said): Taste now My punishment after My warnings!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nagovarati, mamiti","en":"to try to persuade, to entice"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","رَٰوَدُوهُ","عَن","ضَيْفِهِۦ","فَطَمَسْنَآ","أَعْيُنَهُمْ","فَذُوقُوا۟","عَذَابِى","وَنُذُرِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَاوَدَ"}}]